<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE 1 ARMENIA 1 - WORLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE 1 ARMENIA 1 - WORLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine and Armenia drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup European zone group nine qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ukraine - Andriy Shevchenko 6</p>
<p>Armenia - Artur Petrosyan 75</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>    Standings     P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> Ukraine	    7   4   1   2   7   6  13</p>
<p> Germany	    5   3   2   0  11   4  11</p>
<p> Portugal	   6   2   3   1   5   2   9</p>
<p> Northern Ireland 7   1   4   2   5   5   7</p>
<p> Armenia	    6   0   5   1   4   8   5</p>
<p> Albania	    5   0   1   4   3  10   1</p>
<p>Next matches: June 7 Portugal v Albania, Ukraine v Germany</p>
